1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,500
A luxury hotel suite on the tenth floor.

2
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:10,100
The door was bolted from the inside with a heavy iron latch.

3
00:00:10,100 --> 00:00:15,280
Every window was shut tight, and there was no balcony.

4
00:00:15,280 --> 00:00:20,880
When police broke the door down, the guest was already dead.

5
00:00:20,880 --> 00:00:25,430
No sign of a killer, and no way out anywhere.

6
00:00:25,430 --> 00:00:30,890
So how did a murderer vanish from a perfectly sealed room?
